description	"The Bounty Hunter

Based on Open Mode's Bounty Hunter class, with enhanced attributes and a complete arsenal.

^2Weaponry:
- Blaster Pistol (3)
- Blaster Rifle (3)
- Assassin's Rifle (DLT-20A 3)
- Disruptor Rifle (2)
- 3 Thermal Detonators

^8Attributes:
- CTF: 30s Respawn

^3Abilities: 
- 3 Poison Darts ^3[CS1 Melee]
- 6 Tracking Darts ^3[CS2 Melee]
- Gun Kick ^3[CS3]

^2Strengths^7: Mobile, Well armored, and fields a wide array of weapons to deal with enemies at all ranges.
^1Weaknesses^7: Being well rounded it has no particular weaknesses other than not being the best in any one category."